From 32344f9a54f7e93945181cf76843bddd2828d246 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 6ixtyn9-sudo <270680834+6ixtyn9-sudo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:02:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Retain every BetExplorer match's detail and every market the
 odds lane already fetches

For every fixture the BetExplorer odds lane prices, keep the match page's detail
(H2H, recent results, whole league table, multi-book 1x2) and all six market tabs
(1x2, O/U, AH, DNB, DC, BTTS) from responses the lane already fetches: one GET per
market at >=5.1s spacing, per-run request budget, kill switch, schema-2 detail
ledger localdata/betexplorer_match_detail_<day>.json. The standings reading is the
page's whole table (never a truncated excerpt); the H2H list is read to 40 rows.
Observational only; a cache hit makes no request and writes nothing.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
